WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.278
Step 1. Open the Dispense History sub-tab.

1.2
00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:08.901
Here you dispense medicines and other products to a patient from an encounter.

1.3
00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:13.871
Open the encounter, select Medications, then Dispense History.

2.1
00:00:13.871 --> 00:00:18.917
Step 2. Select Dispense. Care opens the location selector.

2.2
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:22.972
At first, it lists only your own locations.

3.1
00:00:22.972 --> 00:00:26.241
Step 3. Select the location to dispense from.

3.2
00:00:26.241 --> 00:00:29.461
To find another location, search for it by name.

3.3
00:00:29.461 --> 00:00:35.126
Select the location that holds the stock, and Care opens the Dispense drawer.

4.1
00:00:35.126 --> 00:00:40.339
Step 4. Add the items. Select Add Item, and search for the product.

4.2
00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:45.375
Care selects the lot that expires first, and sets the quantity to 1.

4.3
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.245
Enter the Quantity you dispense.

5.1
00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:52.416
Step 5. Confirm the dispense. Select Confirm Dispense.

5.2
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:58.152
Care shows Items dispensed successfully, and reduces the stock at the location.

5.3
00:00:58.152 --> 00:01:02.718
The dispense then shows in the Dispense History sub-tab.
